    "detailed_description": "Originally written for the TI-84+ CE calculator, <i>You Want to Watch the World Burn</i> for PC provides a tactile atmospheric retro experience with explosive destruction! <br><br>Features a fun and unique campaign; you will experience the cool game mechanics in many contexts. <br><br>An interactive tutorial allows you to enjoy the mechanics as you learn them. <br><br>Many weapons to help your destruction. <br>The lighter is used for controlled burns. <br>The napalm grenade has a long fuse, but it will cause a large amount of damage. <br>The flamethrower is fast and effective \u2014 great for corridors. <br>The shaped charge blasts fire to all floors at and below where it's placed. <br>The RPG-7 is an anti-tank rocket-propelled grenade launcher. It's effective for exploding things at a distance. <br><br>The textures, sounds, and shaders of the game can be modified for your enjoyment as well.<br>This game has true 320x240 resolution and was initially designed for a calculator. Your purchase additionally comes with the (older) calculator version for free! It is a *.8xp file to send to your TI-84+ CE calculator.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029680/extras/f443f53048379a0fa9c32486dcbc6fa0.poster.avif?t=1740802196\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029680/extras/f443f53048379a0fa9c32486dcbc6fa0.webm?t=1740802196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029680/extras/f443f53048379a0fa9c32486dcbc6fa0.mp4?t=1740802196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Originally written for the TI-84+ CE calculator, <i>You Want to Watch the World Burn</i> for PC provides a tactile atmospheric retro experience with explosive destruction! <br><br>Features a fun and unique campaign; you will experience the cool game mechanics in many contexts. <br><br>An interactive tutorial allows you to enjoy the mechanics as you learn them. <br><br>Many weapons to help your destruction. <br>The lighter is used for controlled burns. <br>The napalm grenade has a long fuse, but it will cause a large amount of damage. <br>The flamethrower is fast and effective \u2014 great for corridors. <br>The shaped charge blasts fire to all floors at and below where it's placed. <br>The RPG-7 is an anti-tank rocket-propelled grenade launcher. It's effective for exploding things at a distance. <br><br>The textures, sounds, and shaders of the game can be modified for your enjoyment as well.<br>This game has true 320x240 resolution and was initially designed for a calculator. Your purchase additionally comes with the (older) calculator version for free! It is a *.8xp file to send to your TI-84+ CE calculator.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029680/extras/f443f53048379a0fa9c32486dcbc6fa0.poster.avif?t=1740802196\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029680/extras/f443f53048379a0fa9c32486dcbc6fa0.webm?t=1740802196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029680/extras/f443f53048379a0fa9c32486dcbc6fa0.mp4?t=1740802196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
